{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩表示，今年國慶黃金周訪港旅客超出預期，加上年尾有多場盛事及活動，有信心全年訪港旅客達到5380萬人次。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n她又說，新皇崗口岸啟用後，會觀察旅客出行模式有否改變，又指不擔心旅客即日來回會影響消費。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T10:59:34.418310+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:42:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T11:37:35.888009+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T10:57:40.244913+00:00","content_hash":"8c12c3c364c170cecdf2cf805416f3aff66410240e5af1a49cc54bd9849b08f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}